# Atmos TRS — LGU + reports workflow

Primary work **begins at LGU tourism and DOT/OPTACA reporting**. Upstream (tourist signup, QR) and downstream (Governor) are context unless the user expands scope.

Full product agreements: `docs/atmos-forms-and-establishment-qr.md`.

## Role → surface

| Role | Starts at | Notes |
|------|-----------|--------|
| LGU tourism | `tourism_dashboard.dart` | Primary — tourists, analytics, DOT export, OPTACA submit, debug seed |
| Provincial / OPTACA | Provincial dashboard + `optaca_report_review_panel` | Inbox/review primary |
| Tourist | Home / QR | Visit data source; seed mid-report work |
| Governor | Governor dashboard | Aggregates from real/seeded data |
| Establishment | `establishment_dashboard_*` | Staff confirm queue for AE stays (`establishment_stay_service`) |

Keep Filipino vs foreign, municipality vs province, spot vs LGU vs **establishment** check-ins distinguishable.

## Data flow

Tourist registered → QR (attraction / LGU / later establishment) → LGU analytics → DOT preview + Excel/PDF → optional OPTACA package → Governor aggregates.

## DOT export (Analytics)

| Rule | Detail |
|------|--------|
| Preview | **Every** catalog form — best-fill from current data + gaps |
| Downloads | **Excel** and **PDF** of that filled content (primary CTAs) |
| Blank official | Secondary/advanced only — not the happy path |
| Pipeline | One aggregate → preview → Excel → PDF |
| Attraction data | Feeds VAR family |
| Confirmed AE stays | Feed DAE family (attraction proxy only if labeled as gap/proxy) |

Extend `dot_report_preview`, `dot_report_export_service`, `dot_report_pdf_export`, `DotReportExportPanel` — do not fork exporters.

## Establishment stay QR (implemented — extend, don’t rebuild)

1. Tourist scans establishment QR → Firestore **pending** stay request.
2. Logged-in staff sees queue/popup on establishment dashboard → enters DAE fields → **Confirm**.
3. Status → **confirmed**; tourist sees receipt/history of that transaction.
4. Reports/DOT count **confirmed** only. Pending ignored.
5. Same day: attraction check-in + hotel stay = **two records**.

Do not overload attraction `qr_checkins` without `qr_type` / `establishmentId`. Prefer stay-request collection linked to `accommodation_establishments`. Extend fillers when stay fields feed DAE.

## Integration boundary

- Prefer **seeding** when demos need volume (`docs/TEST_ACCOUNTS_REPORTS.md`).
- Auth/routing shared — confirm before role→route edits.
- Firestore rules + tagged seeds (`seedTag`, `@misocc-seed.ph`).
- Supabase = report templates/storage only.
- Reuse EmailJS + FCM.

## Temporary seeding

LGU Debug data → `tools/seed_dashboard_analytics.js` → `tools/seed_dummy_data.js` → cleanup tools. Seeds are replaceable.

## Do not confuse context with tasks

`Tourist → QR → LGU → OPTACA → Governor` does not mean implement every hop. Start in LGU / DOT / OPTACA (or establishment stay slice when asked).
